# Data model (selected)

Note: Full schema in app/prisma/schema.prisma. Highlights only; see file for all fields and indexes.

- User — core identity; email/password encrypted; role, jwtKey, country/timezone settings; relations to Budget, UserAccount, PlaidItem, NotificationEvent/Dismissal
- Account — top-level workspace/container for budgets, categories, registers; soft-archiving support
- Budget — belongs to Account; relates to AccountRegister, BillProfile/Instance, Notifications, ReconciliationPeriod
- AccountRegister — the primary ledger entity per budget/account/type; includes balances, credit/loan terms, Plaid linkage (encrypted), asset details, walletAddress (encrypted), crypto chain links; relations to RegisterEntry, Reoccurrence, SavingsGoal, Bill*, Snapshot
- RegisterEntry — individual ledger rows (encrypted description, Plaid fields encrypted); flags for projected/pending/reconciled/matched/balance/manual; optional type/category and plaid data
- RegisterEntryType — label for entry types; referenced by RegisterEntry.typeId
- Reoccurrence — recurring schedule data (intervals, amount adjustments), transfer targets, category; splits and plaid name aliases
- ReoccurrenceSplit — split targets (amount mode fixed/percent) for a reoccurrence
- ReoccurrencePlaidNameAlias — normalized plaid description matching per register to reoccurrence
- SavingsGoal — source/target registers, priority flags, category, sort orders
- Category — hierarchical (parent/children), optional account scope; used by registers, entries, reoccurrences, and defaults on AccountRegister
- Interval — generic interval dictionary (used by reoccurrences and register statements)
- Snapshot models — AccountSnapshot, AccountRegisterSnapshot, RegisterEntrySnapshot for point-in-time persistence
- ReconciliationPeriod/Item — statement reconciliation windows and items, with closing adjustments
- BillProfile/Instance — bill scheduling (profile) and dated bill occurrences with payment linkage
- NotificationEvent/Dismissal — notification stream keyed by kind/fingerprint/occurrence
- PlaidItem, PlaidSyncCursor, PlaidSyncLog — Plaid linking + sync bookkeeping
- Crypto — EvmChain, CryptoRegisterChain, CryptoTokenBalance per register; walletAddress (encrypted) lives on AccountRegister
- CashOnHand — denominations for cash registers tied to AccountRegister
- Rsa — RSA key pairs (for encryption/signing usages)
- OpenAiRequestLog — prompt/completion metadata for auditing
- IntegrationAlert / IntegrationJobLog / AdminAuditLog — operational audit streams

Encryption annotations
- Fields with /// @encrypted are re-encrypted via prisma-field-encryption; *_Hash fields often store deterministic hashes for lookups

Indexes and constraints
- Numerous composite indexes for performance; see schema for functional unique indexes (e.g., Category account/parent/name uniqueness in migration SQL)
